    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2E5 + 7&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2e5 + 7 is a constant used to define array size in the student program, representing a common upper bound in competitive programming for input size; it reflects the algorithmic constraints and environment typical in Chinese coding competitions."</data>
