    <node id="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem context for further learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem context for further learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem context for further learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem context."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供算法竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供算法竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供信息学竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料，网址为https://oi-wiki.org。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供算法竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供算法竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料，网址为https://oi-wiki.org。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供信息学竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"</data>
