      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"硝基甲苯之袭 (Nitrotoluene Attack) is the named problem event in which the student must solve the computational challenge involving XOR and GCD conditions on an array of integers."&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭 (Nitrotoluene Attack) is the named problem event in which the student must solve the computational challenge involving XOR and GCD conditions on an array of integers."&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭 (Nitrotoluene Attack) is the named problem event or challenge in which the student must solve the array pair counting problem under the XOR-GCD constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭 (Nitrotoluene Attack) is the named problem event or contest title under which the array XOR-GCD counting problem is presented."&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭 (Nitrotoluene Attack) is the named problem event or challenge presented to the student, involving the computation of valid pairs under a bitwise and number-theoretic condition."</data>
