      <data key="d0">"KNOWLEDGE_POINT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A FIFO data structure for ordered processing; not used in the implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A First-In-First-Out (FIFO) data structure used in breadth-first search, scheduling, and buffering, frequently tested in problems involving sequential processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A linear data structure following First-In-First-Out (FIFO) principle, used in scheduling, breadth-first search, and resource management, often relevant in algorithmic problem solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A linear data structure following First-In-First-Out (FIFO) principle, used in scheduling, breadth-first search, and resource management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Good: 未使用队列，与问题无关，无误解。"&lt;SEP&gt;"A linear data structure following the First-In-First-Out (FIFO) principle, frequently used in breadth-first search and scheduling algorithms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Queue is employed as a FIFO data structure to manage the order of cell exploration in BFS, ensuring level-by-level traversal of the graph."&lt;SEP&gt;"Queue is used as a data structure to manage the order of cell exploration in the BFS algorithm, ensuring level-by-level traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Queue is not used; there is no FIFO structure or breadth-first traversal present."&lt;SEP&gt;"Queue is a data structure used in the student's BFS algorithm to explore possible transformations of the number n, representing a first-in-first-out mechanism for state exploration."&lt;SEP&gt;"No queue data structure is utilized; there is no breadth-first traversal or FIFO processing in the algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"A FIFO data structure; not used or implied in the student's code or problem context."&lt;SEP&gt;"A knowledge point involving FIFO data structures; not present or relevant in the student’s code."&lt;SEP&gt;"A knowledge point referring to FIFO data structures — not used in the student’s code."&lt;SEP&gt;"A first-in-first-out (FIFO) data structure; not mentioned in error description, so student likely has good grasp."&lt;SEP&gt;"Not mentioned in error description; student likely understands this concept."&lt;SEP&gt;"Not mentioned in error description; student likely understands this concept or it is not tested in this submission."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ea9ae7a51aebab6821f40062b4d3226b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1ad044dbd1541b2995314fe5a633c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6c899f823d305879d17d86ecb45a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aaaaf6498588ecfeff6d1bb4b57185fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33b73767750d16af269cfd907acea934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d513b4e5ac4753a8c4299f06737d9f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59944da035dd8848dbabf91e4b73ff88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc13f3cc7f5b3af45d1ad4e19c942b49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bef65f0a968ef3a0849ac39bbd081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18e96e1c770e179fa3bc6a50d441a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab3a2497782f2369f045518e829f36ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80238b5fffb44ffa0ed8e2b2ac553255&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb62e57098228f41920f39d20ae4d2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-055102857bcf4a75299a342e46dbdf11</data>
