      <data key="d1">"The Program is the student’s code or solution submitted as part of their response, used alongside the error description to assess their technical understanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program is the student's code or solution submission, which, along with the error description, forms the primary data used to evaluate their understanding of the underlying knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code or computational solution submitted to solve the problem, evaluated for functionality, logic, and adherence to requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program is the student’s code or solution submitted as part of an assessment, analyzed alongside the error description to determine the student’s grasp of relevant knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program is the student's coded solution submitted as part of an assessment, analyzed to determine their understanding of relevant knowledge points."</data>
