    <node id="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can unleash a 'Dragon's Breath' ability to destroy monsters on a grid map, aiming to maximize the number of monsters eliminated in a single attack."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the ability 'Dragon's Breath' to eliminate monsters on a grid map by targeting specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the protagonist who controls a dragon to unleash 'Dragon's Breath' on a grid to eliminate monsters, aiming to maximize the number of defeated monsters in a single attack."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the ability 'Dragon's Breath' to eliminate monsters on a grid map by targeting specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can unleash a special ability called 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the ability 'Dragon's Breath' to eliminate monsters on a grid map by targeting coordinates and triggering diagonal flame patterns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the name associated with a problem involving a sequence of random integers and the computation of the expected value of the sum of absolute differences between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the name associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the expected value of the sum of absolute differences between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the name associated with a problem involving a sequence of randomly generated integers and the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the name associated with a problem involving a sequence of integers with random values in given intervals, aiming to compute the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the name 