    <node id="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that destroys monsters in a diagonal 'X' pattern centered at a chosen grid coordinate, affecting cells along four diagonal directions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters along diagonal lines extending from a targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters along diagonal lines extending from a chosen coordinate (x,y) in four diagonal directions: (x-1,y-1), (x-1,y+1), (x+1,y-1), (x+1,y+1)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from the targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from a chosen coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters along four diagonal directions from a target coordinate (x,y)."</data>
