    <node id="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"'y' is the cost in yuan for swapping any two bits in either a or b, a key parameter in the optimization objective."&lt;SEP&gt;"y是交换任意两个位（在a或b中）所需花费的单位成本，是优化问题中的关键参数，与x比较决定最优策略。"&lt;SEP&gt;"y is the cost in yuan for performing a single bit-swap operation on either a or b."&lt;SEP&gt;"y is a parameter or weight used in the arithmetic expression, likely representing a secondary cost or penalty applied to remaining elements after Min selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"y是交换二进制数a或b中任意两位所需花费的单位成本，是优化目标中的关键参数。"&lt;SEP&gt;"y is the cost in yuan for performing a single bit-swap operation on either a or b."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0dfdf42008b0416959725ff99bf52414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-583327d1ca0d6043bcd282a108af1a4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aa219dac75bf066df67ce60e89bfb70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d35334ea05ab1a03cfcf22d7faec2d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73</data>
    </node>
