      <data key="d1">"BFS (Breadth-First Search) is the algorithmic event employed by the student to systematically explore all possible number transformations from n to m using the allowed operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"BFS (Breadth-First Search) is the algorithmic technique used in the student's program to explore all possible transformations of number n to reach m, using queue-based state exploration."</data>
