    </node>
    <node id="&quot;O&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"'O' represents the symbol placed by 炸鸡 on the tic-tac-toe board, indicating their moves in the grid positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing the moves made by 炸鸡 on the tic-tac-toe board, occupying cells in the 3x3 grid as part of the game state."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing 炸鸡's棋子 (piece) on the tic-tac-toe board, placed in cells to form winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"O represents a mark placed by 炸鸡 on the tic-tac-toe board, indicating one of the opponent's choices in the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing the moves made by 炸鸡 on the tic-tac-toe board, indicating ownership of a cell in the 3x3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing炸鸡's moves on the tic-tac-toe board, occupying cells in rows and columns to form winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing炸鸡's moves on the tic-tac-toe board, occupying cells in the 3x3 grid to form winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing the moves made by 炸鸡 on the tic-tac-toe board, occupying positions in the 3x3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing炸鸡's moves on the tic-tac-toe board, occupying cells in the 3x3 grid to form winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol used on the tic-tac-toe board to represent moves made by 炸鸡, occupying cells in the 3x3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol representing the moves made by 炸鸡 on the tic-tac-toe board, indicating ownership of a cell in the 3x3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is the symbol used by 炸鸡 to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, representing the opponent's pieces in the game state."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a symbol used on the tic-tac-toe board to represent moves made by 炸鸡, occupying positions in the 3x3 grid."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9094a057465f864e453c5144b5d5d992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705de323687561c70c4a2f8771b3b928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6530b007a9358e324c34f0aa9343b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb6bd690dda1f038950ffac0d14585f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864b5222b680eb70bf8268c99a7b1400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-651bf95b9e43b516237d957526d8b15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3de2ef34caee6189dbc97fdff1369967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1b94b066ee2977324f512fa79346b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ce97d6733d48f34e9d3b2ae71fd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ee66e423ab2b4d0bfaddf5206078&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f9203ade2bda3f53be8c235e592782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5470d8b2aa46bdc4dcacc08c4ef251c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55c048498a23dc287d54f7c9494356f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The tic-tac-toe game is a 3x3 grid-based strategic contest between 小L and 炸鸡, where the goal is to get three marks in a row, column, or diagonal, with a special rule allowing 小L one turn of two consecutive moves."&lt;SEP&gt;The tic-tac-toe game is a 3x3 grid-based strategic, turn-based contest between 小L and 炸鸡, in which players alternately place X and O marks with the objective of forming a line of three—horizontally, vertically, or diagonally. The current game state is a draw, with both players having made an equal number of moves and no winner yet determined. It is now 小L’s turn to move, and 小L possesses a one-time, special privilege to make two consecutive moves in this single turn. This variant introduces an unusual rule not found in standard tic-tac-toe, transforming the traditional equilibrium of play and introducing a strategic advantage for 小L in this residual position (残局). Despite the draw-like state, the game remains active due to this unique two-move privilege, which could potentially break the stalemate and lead to a decisive outcome.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-864b5222b680eb70bf8268c99a7b1400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d33c7ef9d380215e34dd28e71195f7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc401d350f3efc5b60eafbfeb2d99039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1b94b066ee2977324f512fa79346b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ce97d6733d48f34e9d3b2ae71fd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c62792f82acfe7a3c8c6db1819eb069d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c2b97469d5e678dbca20fdac418f486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5470d8b2aa46bdc4dcacc08c4ef251c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24766056ca9ad4e7b4405e0bfea55b58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;3X3 GRID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 3x3 Grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of 9 cells arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns, where moves by小L and炸鸡 are placed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 Grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of 9 cells arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns, where pieces are placed and winning lines are formed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 Grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of 9 cells arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns, where players place X, O, or leave as G."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of nine positions identified by (i,j) coordinates where players place their marks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of nine cells arranged in three rows and three columns, where players place X, O, or leave as G."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of 9 cells arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns, where players place X, O, or leave as G."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 Grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of 9 cells arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns, where players place their marks to win."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of 9 cells arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns, where players place X, O, or leave G as empty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 Grid is the structured playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of nine cells arranged in three rows and three columns, where players place X, O, or leave G for empty positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 Grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of 9 cells arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns, where players place their marks (X or O)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9094a057465f864e453c5144b5d5d992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705de323687561c70c4a2f8771b3b928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6530b007a9358e324c34f0aa9343b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864b5222b680eb70bf8268c99a7b1400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1b94b066ee2977324f512fa79346b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ce97d6733d48f34e9d3b2ae71fd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ee66e423ab2b4d0bfaddf5206078&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f9203ade2bda3f53be8c235e592782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5470d8b2aa46bdc4dcacc08c4ef251c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55c048498a23dc287d54f7c9494356f</data>
