      <data key="d3">62.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 initiates the mathematical event of constructing a 3x3 determinant with specific constraints, making her the problem's originator."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the requester of the 3阶行列式 construction task, establishing the problem's objective and constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 initiates the request to construct the 3x3 determinant, making her the problem's originator and the reason the task exists."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 requests the construction of a 3x3 determinant with specific constraints, making her the problem originator and the determinant the object of her request."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person requesting the construction of the 3x3 determinant, making her the problem initiator and primary stakeholder."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 requests the construction of the 3x3 determinant, making her the originator of the problem and the entity for whom the solution is intended."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 specifically requests the construction of a 3rd-order determinant, defining the scope of the mathematical problem."</data>
