    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;PROBLEM CONTEXT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 is the originator of the problem context, defining the conditions for a '好矩阵' and the allowed operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the originator of the problem context, requesting the determinant construction that the entire scenario revolves around."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the originator of the problem context, defining the rules and constraints for the 'good matrix' transformation task."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the originator of the problem context, defining the mathematical conditions and constraints for the '好矩阵' transformation task."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f97b7273e9cd49bbbd3b2dcef862908b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98f7559a33bedc5f901d766c18542da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab4f5bf86ada7b486cce8436e89108f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-167bf23db68d82578bef6b617284955f</data>
