    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">186.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 defines the problem that the Student Program attempts to solve, making the program a direct attempt to fulfill her specified conditions for a '好矩阵'. "&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的问题被学生尝试通过编程实现，学生程序是为解决小红定义的‘好矩阵’转换任务而编写的，存在直接的上下文依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;The Student Program is a direct implementation attempt by a student to solve a problem defined and posed by 小红, who is the problem author and requester. 小红’s problem centers on constructing a “好矩阵” (good matrix) through a specific transformation task involving the doubling of a subarray, with the goal of achieving a determinant of value x while adhering to defined constraints. The Student Program was created as a direct response to 小红’s requirements, aiming to fulfill her specified transformation rules and conditions for the matrix. However, despite being designed to achieve 小红’s goal, the program contains critical errors—particularly in its logic for updating the maximum and minimum values after subarray doubling—which result in suboptimal or incorrect outcomes. These flaws indicate a gap in the student’s understanding of the problem’s underlying requirements and the precise conditions needed to construct a valid “好矩阵.” Thus, while the Student Program is a direct and intentional attempt to realize 小红’s defined challenge, its incorrect behavior reveals that the solution has not yet successfully met her intended criteria, leaving her problem unresolved.&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the problem designer, and the Student Program is an attempt by a learner to implement a solution to her defined problem, establishing a direct problem-solution relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem is being solved by the student via the submitted program, making her the problem author and the student's program the attempted solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem is being solved by the student program, which attempts to implement the required matrix transformation but contains logical errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the problem designer, and the student program is an attempted solution to her defined problem; the program's errors reflect a misunderstanding of the required logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the problem setter, and the student program is an attempted solution to her defined problem, making the program a direct response to her requirements."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cf3655e2f9ff0ad97a40cbb5e827990f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c45ae6d217837b0ec49eaf31b3f5388&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd98342443974d00046bbc62a7ae1f50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a588519a4b977de5b0bcf8ded42f8642&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b80c66cbff74b6030244a0523bb9e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6ae6c968489276c8bb614966bd0f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380516e7c123a163827ef2c408fb1400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bfafcf2098d0e8657e26e5ca39cfbc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf205584a12138b86107f950268b071f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd2069b32b3ad84665dc044ac51f497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bd4c7c33601a905c773b5092cf3a9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d945665931d7322be0eab1acd39ad26e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97b7273e9cd49bbbd3b2dcef862908b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e4b814718769c7c5ff34fd8d9992e16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7505a8a58bc2ae0a0f49a4f4a99ca45c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f273c58705b21c2ef1fc6c43ff66b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab4f5bf86ada7b486cce8436e89108f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246822371b4a88626131f0e16a7011d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfb1c8a2a7c5ab2297cc1bce76d8554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60231925bd696a34976f33351b0f3da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cd35d2da3ec05d7b2e867504beda050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545cb269f14609feb72aa54e1397a88f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4524936a6b8c2ae52a229c861568c00f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
