    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">61.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 is the one who initiated the problem event 井然有序之窗, requesting a solution to construct a valid permutation."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who initiated the problem event '井然有序之窗' by requesting a permutation under range constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who posed the problem event 井然有序之窗, requesting a valid permutation under range constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the requester who defined the problem event '井然有序之窗', establishing its constraints and objectives."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the requester of the solution to the event 井然有序之窗, which involves constructing a permutation under specific constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the requester of the '井然有序之窗' problem, initiating the need for a permutation solution under range constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who posed the problem '井然有序之窗', making her the originator and stakeholder of the event."</data>
