      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 requires the permutation to be constructed using exactly the integers from 1 to n, making this range fundamental to the problem's validity."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 requires the permutation to use all integers from 1 to n, establishing 1 \sim n as the fundamental value set for the problem."</data>
