      <data key="d4">"小红 imposes the [l_i,r_i] constraints on each position i, defining the core problem condition that the Student Program must satisfy."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 specifies that each element at position i must lie within [l_i,r_i], defining the core constraint of the problem."</data>
