    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">42.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program is written in C++ using conventions common in Chinese competitive programming (e.g., #define int long long, std::pair), indicating its origin in China's ACM/NOI training ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is written in C++ with Chinese problem context, typical of programming competitions in China (e.g., NOI, ICPC), indicating the cultural and educational geo-context of the implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student program is written in a Chinese educational context, evidenced by the Chinese problem statement and programming environment typical in Chinese academic settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student program is written in Chinese programming contest context (e.g., using #include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;, std::cin), indicating cultural and educational context of China."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is written in a style and language (C++ with Chinese problem context) typical of Chinese programming competitions, indicating its cultural and educational origin in China. "&lt;SEP&gt;"该学生程序以中文注释和中国编程竞赛常见风格编写，表明其背景为中国信息学竞赛环境，使用标准C++语法与竞赛惯用写法（如#define int long long）。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4bd4c7c33601a905c773b5092cf3a9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfb1c8a2a7c5ab2297cc1bce76d8554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60231925bd696a34976f33351b0f3da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cd35d2da3ec05d7b2e867504beda050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-167bf23db68d82578bef6b617284955f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad12dbd91d84d77d978a49fdce06b10</data>
