    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"'双生数组'作为一道典型的中国编程竞赛风格题目，其命名方式（双生双宿之错）和解题结构符合中国信息学奥赛（NOI）常见题型特征。"&lt;SEP&gt;"'双生数组'作为一道典型的中文编程竞赛题，其命名风格和解题逻辑常见于中国信息学奥赛（NOI）等场景，体现中国编程教育的特色问题设计。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘双生数组’作为编程竞赛题目的核心概念，出现在中文语境下的教育与竞赛体系中，体现中国编程教育的典型问题设计风格。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘双生数组’问题源自中文编程题目，反映中国编程竞赛中常见的算法设计风格。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8bd847ee4bb18545e7523cd52f77dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-491b51dba2652c663fb7ffdf86cf09c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e71bd5f93d74a52e913bc532b569f8b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">80.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Chinese competitive programming often includes problems requiring enumeration and sorting of grid positions, reflecting the curriculum’s focus on structured algorithmic thinking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration and Sorting are foundational topics in Chinese algorithmic training, frequently tested in contests like NOI, making their relevance to this problem culturally and educationally grounded in China."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛常考排序与枚举结合的问题，'双生数组'题型符合中国NOI风格，该知识点在此语境下高频出现。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛常考排序与枚举问题，该题风格符合中国算法训练体系对基础排序应用的重视。"&lt;SEP&gt;"在中国编程竞赛体系中，排序与枚举是基础且高频考察的知识点，该题的设计符合中国信息学竞赛的典型风格。"&lt;SEP&gt;"在中国编程竞赛中，排序与枚举是解决此类数组优化题的标准技巧，该知识点广泛用于NOI/ICPC风格题目。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛常考枚举与排序类问题，该题中'1'的重定位正是此类知识的典型应用。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration and sorting techniques are emphasized in Chinese algorithmic education, and this problem reflects that focus through its need to reposition matrix elements systematically."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration and sorting problems are common in Chinese algorithmic contests, indicating this knowledge point is embedded in the Chinese CS education context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration_and_Sorting is a commonly emphasized algorithmic skill in Chinese programming competitions, where problems like '好矩阵' require systematic enumeration and ordering of elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chinese competitive programming problems often use enumeration and sorting as foundational techniques, suggesting this problem expects such methods in the solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6247e0c09a8368e71631b60beb57a0bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f6856b0857c340a0a736de1a173d764&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bd847ee4bb18545e7523cd52f77dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1e600afd93ca192eb8ffc6cb8cc292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-491b51dba2652c663fb7ffdf86cf09c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa396a1e574085f91576e710eaa87a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5448b6a1f2bc39e282db3976a922f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fedfd8dc5bb3022a25bfcc5fe660373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e400700ddd5c7295c464b96b4722c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410c9ee9aeea30ffa768d055e5128a0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">80.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Greedy algorithms are a core component of Chinese competitive programming curricula, and this problem's optimal solution structure aligns with the greedy paradigms commonly taught and tested in China."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国信息学竞赛中，贪心策略是解决最小化绝对偏差类问题的主流方法，本题正是典型代表，体现中国竞赛对贪心的重视。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国算法教育强调贪心策略在最小化问题中的应用，该题是典型贪心题型，学生虽尝试但实现错误，符合常见教学误区。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程教育强调贪心策略在优化问题中的应用，本题的中位数贪心解法是典型教学案例，体现中国竞赛对思维模型的偏好。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国信息学竞赛常考贪心策略在中位数最小化问题中的应用，该问题设计符合中国竞赛典型模式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy algorithms are a staple in Chinese algorithmic contests, and this problem’s optimal solution is greedy — aligning with typical Chinese OI problem design."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国算法训练强调贪心策略在构造性问题中的应用，本题中最小化交换次数的需求正符合这一教学重点。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy algorithms are a core component of Chinese programming contests, and this problem's optimal solution relies on greedy placement of '1's to minimize operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy algorithms are frequently emphasized in Chinese OI/ACM training, aligning this knowledge point with the country's competitive programming pedagogy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy algorithms are a staple in Chinese OI curricula, and this problem’s design suggests it was intended to be solved greedily, reflecting standard pedagogical expectations in China."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6247e0c09a8368e71631b60beb57a0bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f6856b0857c340a0a736de1a173d764&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bd847ee4bb18545e7523cd52f77dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1e600afd93ca192eb8ffc6cb8cc292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-491b51dba2652c663fb7ffdf86cf09c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa396a1e574085f91576e710eaa87a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5448b6a1f2bc39e282db3976a922f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fedfd8dc5bb3022a25bfcc5fe660373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e400700ddd5c7295c464b96b4722c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Control structures like loops and conditionals are fundamental in Chinese coding education, and this problem's multi-test-case structure reflects that standard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Control structures such as nested loops and conditional termination are heavily emphasized in Chinese programming education, and this problem’s solution demands them — suggesting the student’s error may reflect insufficient training in complex control flow."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国竞赛题常设计复杂控制流以测试逻辑严谨性，学生代码中的条件分支体现其应对此类题型的训练背景。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛中复杂控制结构常作为区分高分选手的点，学生在此处的逻辑错误（如非法数组索引）是典型教学中需纠正的陷阱。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛题目常设计复杂控制流陷阱，本题中cnt1--的逻辑错误是典型陷阱，反映中国题目对控制结构严谨性的高要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国算法题注重逻辑严谨性，本题的嵌套循环与边界控制体现了中国编程教育对控制结构的高要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8bd847ee4bb18545e7523cd52f77dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f6856b0857c340a0a736de1a173d764&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1e600afd93ca192eb8ffc6cb8cc292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5448b6a1f2bc39e282db3976a922f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e400700ddd5c7295c464b96b4722c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;INPUT_OUTPUT_AND_SEQUENTIAL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Chinese programming competitions demand strict adherence to input/output formats, as seen in this problem's requirement to output swap sequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chinese programming competitions place high importance on precise I/O handling and sequential output, and the student’s output error may stem from not adhering to expected format standards common in Chinese OI platforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛强调高效I/O，学生使用ios::sync_with_stdio符合中国选手标准实践，体现该语境下的编程规范。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程题普遍要求标准输入输出和顺序处理，学生正确实现，符合国内竞赛规范。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程题普遍严格要求输入输出格式，本题的交换序列输出正是这一规范的体现。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Input_Output_and_Sequential_Structure is a fundamental requirement in Chinese programming contests, where precise I/O handling and step-by-step execution are strictly evaluated, as seen in this problem’s output format."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chinese programming competition context implies standardized I/O formats (e.g., cin/cout with sync disabled), which are critical for correct output in the student’s program."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8bd847ee4bb18545e7523cd52f77dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f6856b0857c340a0a736de1a173d764&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5448b6a1f2bc39e282db3976a922f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fedfd8dc5bb3022a25bfcc5fe660373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e400700ddd5c7295c464b96b4722c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410c9ee9aeea30ffa768d055e5128a0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
