    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">56.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variables 'n' and 'm' define the dimensions of the 2D array 'a' and are used together to bound nested loops for traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"n and m are input parameters where m must be feasible given n, as the 可爱度 cannot exceed n and is constrained by the structure of possible substrings and subsequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"n and m are input parameters where m must be less than or equal to n for a valid 可爱度 to exist, establishing a mathematical dependency."&lt;SEP&gt;"n 和 m 通过约束条件 n &gt; m 与 n - m ≤ 26 相关联，共同决定是否存在满足条件的字符串，是问题逻辑的核心输入对。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n和m是问题的两个输入参数，学生程序需根据n和m的值判断是否存在满足可爱度m的长度为n的字符串，二者在逻辑上紧密关联。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n and m together define the dimensions of the Grid Map, determining its total size and the range of valid (i,j) coordinates for Dragon's Breath deployment."&lt;SEP&gt;"n and m are the start and end states in the transformation problem; the goal is to determine if a sequence of operations can convert n into m."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e22ff6fc321d7eede1c2519238ccbc58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c5a9f768d5896586a40aa9a5d5e578d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n determines the exact length that string t must have, constraining all possible solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是字符串 t 的长度约束，直接决定 t 的构造规模和可行性，是输入参数与输出对象之间的核心关联。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb</data>
