    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">52.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable 'n' defines the number of rows in the 2D array 'a', establishing the array's dimensionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the expected row size of array a, but without explicit declaration or bounds checking, the program assumes correct array dimensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the length of binary number a, constraining the number of possible bit positions for operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了二进制数a的长度，决定a包含的位数和可操作范围。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of bits in a, constraining the scope of possible operations on a."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了二进制数a的长度，是a的结构基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the bit-length of a, constraining the domain of possible operations and configurations for a."</data>
