      <data key="d4">"n defines the bit-length of b, constraining the domain of possible operations and configurations for b."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the length of binary number b, constraining the number of possible bit positions for operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了二进制数b的长度，决定b包含的位数和可操作范围。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of bits in b, constraining the scope of possible operations on b."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了二进制数b的长度，是b的结构基础。"</data>
