      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program attempts to construct the 3x3 determinant as requested, but contains logical errors in computing one element to meet the determinant value x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to solve the 3阶行列式 problem by generating a matrix whose determinant equals x, but contains logical errors in computing the required element e."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted implementation of the 3阶行列式 construction task, aiming to satisfy its mathematical constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to generate a 3x3 determinant matrix based on input x, but fails to satisfy the constraint that det = x due to flawed computation of element e."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to generate a 3x3 determinant matrix, directly implementing the structure and constraints requested by 小红."</data>
