      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program is an attempted solution to the '数值膨胀之美' problem, using sorting, prefix/suffix arrays, and interval tracking, but fails due to incorrect handling of the maximum and minimum after multiplication."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is the submitted solution attempt to the '数值膨胀之美' problem, attempting to implement the required logic but containing critical errors in range calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序是对‘数值膨胀之美’这一问题的解答尝试，其错误反映了对问题数学美感与策略的误解。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted solution to the 数值膨胀之美 problem, implementing sorting and greedy logic but failing due to incorrect boundary updates."</data>
