    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">70.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program attempts a greedy approach by iterating over possible doubling points, but incorrectly calculates the new max and min due to flawed boundary logic (e.g., using a[i+1] without checking bounds and not considering all cases), leading to incorrect results."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program includes a greedy assignment strategy (incrementing l and assigning to a[i].id), showing attempted application of Greedy approach, but implementation is incomplete or flawed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem is classically solvable with a greedy approach; the student's incorrect answer suggests a misunderstanding or misapplication of greedy logic in selecting the optimal subarray to double."&lt;SEP&gt;"问题最优解通常为贪心策略，学生错误答案表明其贪心选择（如选哪个区间）逻辑错误，未能正确识别最优操作区间。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program uses a greedy strategy to assign the smallest available integer within each interval, demonstrating attempted application of the Greedy knowledge point."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program uses a greedy approach by sequentially placing each encountered '1' into the next available slot in the top-left quadrant, prioritizing local optimality over global cost minimization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student program uses a greedy strategy to move each '1' directly to the target quadrant without considering global optimality, demonstrating application of the Greedy knowledge point."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student’s algorithm uses a greedy strategy by immediately relocating each '1' to the nearest valid position in the top-left quadrant without considering future consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's algorithm greedily moves each '1' to the closest available spot in the target quadrant without considering global optimality, which is the core flaw indicated in the error description."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8f273c58705b21c2ef1fc6c43ff66b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bfafcf2098d0e8657e26e5ca39cfbc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf205584a12138b86107f950268b071f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd98342443974d00046bbc62a7ae1f50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545cb269f14609feb72aa54e1397a88f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b80c66cbff74b6030244a0523bb9e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4524936a6b8c2ae52a229c861568c00f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d720ee12ae214beef8f6c0dc5728db8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
