      <data key="d3">11.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem could be solved with DP, but the student's incorrect output suggests they either did not use DP or implemented it incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生可能尝试DP但状态设计错误（如未记录是否已操作），或转移方程不完整，导致无法正确计算最小极差。"</data>
