      <data key="d4">"Binary search on the answer is a possible optimization; the student's error suggests they did not employ or misapplied this technique."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生可能试图二分极差答案，但未正确构建‘是否可达到某极差’的判定函数，或边界设置错误。"</data>
