      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 的目标是生成一个‘好矩阵’，但其算法逻辑存在缺陷，导致无法正确达成该事件所定义的目标状态。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform the input matrix into the '好矩阵' state through simulated swaps, making it the procedural agent targeting this event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student program aims to transform the input matrix into a 好矩阵 using swap operations, making it the procedural means to achieve the target event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform the input matrix into a '好矩阵' by simulating adjacent swaps, making it a computational attempt to achieve the target event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student program aims to transform the input matrix into the '好矩阵' state using adjacent swaps, making it a procedural attempt to achieve the target event."</data>
