    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 是为解决《小鸡的排列构造》题目而编写的代码实现，试图正确处理区间排序后的位置查询。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to implement a checker for 《小鸡的排列构造》 using persistent segment trees to answer range-based position queries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是为解决《小鸡的排列构造》题目而编写的代码，直接针对该事件的需求进行实现。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是为解决《小鸡的排列构造》题目而编写的代码，直接针对该事件的求解需求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c242cddb305e8c965ab852377b57233</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;L_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 读取 l_i 作为查询区间的左端点，用于定位需要排序的子数组范围。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program reads l_i for each query to define the left boundary of the range for which element counts are computed."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 读取 r_i 作为查询区间的右端点，用于定位需要排序的子数组范围。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program reads r_i for each query to define the right boundary of the range for segment tree queries."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 使用 c_i 作为目标位置，通过 query 函数计算其元素排序后的新位置。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program uses c_i to access the value a[c_i] and compute its rank in the range [l_i, r_i] to determine its new position."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;A[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program stores the input permutation in array a[i], which is the basis for building the persistent segment tree."&lt;SEP&gt;"a[i] 是 Student Program 中存储排列 p 的具体数组变量，是所有操作的数据载体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;ROOT[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program builds root[i] as the persistent segment tree state after processing the i-th element, enabling efficient range queries."&lt;SEP&gt;"root[i] 是 Student Program 中构建可持久化线段树的关键结构，用于保存每个前缀版本的根节点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T 是 Student Program 中用于动态分配线段树节点的计数器，支撑可持久化结构的版本管理。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program uses T to dynamically allocate new nodes in the persistent segment tree, tracking node creation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;CNT[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program uses cnt[] to store the number of elements in each segment tree node, enabling range sum queries."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt[] 是 Student Program 中记录每个节点覆盖范围内元素数量的数组，是 query 函数实现的基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;LS[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program uses ls[] to maintain left child pointers in the persistent segment tree structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"ls[] 是 Student Program 中构建线段树左子树结构的索引数组，支撑区间分割逻辑。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;RS[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program uses rs[] to maintain right child pointers in the persistent segment tree structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"rs[] 是 Student Program 中构建线段树右子树结构的索引数组，支撑区间分割逻辑。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2411c621877139af242bccc0cd3326b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;小鸡&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡作为出题者，期望学生提交的程序能正确解决《小鸡的排列构造》问题，Student Program 是对小鸡题目的直接实现尝试。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是题目设计者，Student Program 是为解决其设计的问题而提交的代码，二者是问题与解决方案的对应关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-25a5ffde3e6b26abceb9147a7b795dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c242cddb305e8c965ab852377b57233</data>
