    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">121.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Error Description explicitly identifies flaws in the student’s conditional logic for computing e, indicating a misunderstanding of how control structures should handle edge cases for x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The incorrect conditional logic in loop bounds (e.g., j - i + 1 &lt;= 0) reveals a flawed understanding of loop control structures managing array indices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The conditional logic (if/else) in the code may be misapplied, leading to incorrect branching when Cnt and Min are evaluated, resulting in wrong arithmetic paths."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code includes if-else branches and complex arithmetic conditions, and the error indicates a flaw in how control flow or logical expressions are evaluated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's error likely stems from incorrect use of control structures (e.g., improper flag resetting, incorrect condition logic in nested if-statements), leading to flawed counting or boolean evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's error stems from incorrect use of boolean flags (f) and conditional logic within nested loops, leading to flawed state tracking—indicating misunderstanding of control flow and flag reset logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's incorrect use of nested if and for loops with flawed conditions (e.g., 3 - k + 1) demonstrates a misunderstanding of control flow logic in array traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nested if-statements and loop conditions in the code suggest the student misapplied control flow logic, causing incorrect flag assignment and state evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code contains complex nested conditionals and loops, but the logic for setting flags and counters is flawed, indicating misunderstanding of control flow structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code uses nested if-statements and loops with flags (f, cnt), indicating confusion in control flow logic, particularly around conditional evaluation and flag resetting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code contains flawed control flow logic (e.g., misuse of f and flag variables, incorrect loop conditions), indicating a misunderstanding of conditional and loop structures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description highlights incorrect use of control structures (if statements and flag variables), indicating the student misunderstands how to properly manage boolean state in nested loops."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description indicates the student’s code contains incorrect logic in control structures (nested loops and flag conditions), leading to wrong output."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code contains nested loops and conditional checks (e.g., 'if(a[k][3 - k + 1] &gt; 1) f = 1;'), indicating a misunderstanding in how control structures should be applied to validate grid conditions correctly."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52543ca7da1d4a9ba677841843749191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9ae7a51aebab6821f40062b4d3226b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-583327d1ca0d6043bcd282a108af1a4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3be5d2e7b4cdc0624a78ec7eea0965b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebc4bde127c899173d8ce8f82274102b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bef65f0a968ef3a0849ac39bbd081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc13f3cc7f5b3af45d1ad4e19c942b49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b2c89ce18073790268729bdeee92b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d92e16219582b9326647688714ca17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d59b725cdca1ae7922077ce5da4c129a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb62e57098228f41920f39d20ae4d2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88fa16b4f4700aea35ca6e79d0208cea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0578a35809a5b5cc19052ef0d6078e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45490059e4c46d4b5d35da604f2ccf3f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;INPUT_OUTPUT_AND_SEQUENTIAL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">46.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Error Description does not criticize input/output or sequential flow, implying the student correctly implemented these aspects despite computational errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The output sum is miscalculated due to improper sequential accumulation of diagonal elements, showing a breakdown in input-output flow logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's incorrect answer likely stems from flawed handling of sequential input processing or output formatting, as the error is described as a discrepancy between expected and actual output."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description implies a failure in correct input processing or output formatting, suggesting the student may not fully grasp sequential data flow."&lt;SEP&gt;"The code follows a sequential structure to read and evaluate array elements, but the output (flag, cnt) is not correctly computed due to flawed logic, indicating misunderstanding of input-to-output flow."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student’s incorrect answer likely stems from misunderstanding how input data is processed sequentially, leading to flawed output generation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error suggests misunderstanding in input handling or sequential logic, as the code contains conditional checks on array elements that may misrepresent data flow."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-583327d1ca0d6043bcd282a108af1a4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebc4bde127c899173d8ce8f82274102b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bef65f0a968ef3a0849ac39bbd081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b2c89ce18073790268729bdeee92b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d92e16219582b9326647688714ca17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d59b725cdca1ae7922077ce5da4c129a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88fa16b4f4700aea35ca6e79d0208cea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
