      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The error description is generated based on analysis of the student's program, highlighting flaws or deviations from expected behavior in entity extraction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description is generated based on the performance of the student's program, highlighting its failures or limitations in entity extraction."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-40dcea99152c33d48a952a30c8a3cbb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466f0469322efc625bdf0793f2afb8b7</data>
