    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">75.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student provided the Error Description, reflecting their self-assessment and metacognitive awareness of their work."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student provided or is associated with the error description, which is critical for interpreting their comprehension of the knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's submission generates an error description that is used to evaluate their understanding and skill level."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's submission includes or is accompanied by an error description that details flaws in their program."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's submission is accompanied by an error description that either confirms correctness or identifies misunderstandings, directly informing the mastery evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's answer is evaluated through the error description, which directly reflects their understanding or misconception."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student provided the error description to explain their understanding or misunderstanding of the problem, which is critical for evaluating their mastery level."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted code that triggered the error description due to incorrect implementation of matrix condition checks."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-004ef4fc2ed15929827169f862ebd088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18ae858b750790591a327c7d142473ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c667d557d4fb1e9f0b759d48acec31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24a1b23c6ef98a895ddcdfb7da26877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5291e8c8d87427d45354665dbecd763b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc13f3cc7f5b3af45d1ad4e19c942b49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7258c56b189afe5558686950c289cc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb545e46aabe21f67de0b3e0da010f7</data>
