      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;SUBMISSION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The submission includes an error description formatted as 'Bad: [description]', which is critical for determining the student's mastery level."&lt;SEP&gt;"The submission includes an error description that analyzes the shortcomings of the submitted program."&lt;SEP&gt;"The submission is analyzed to generate the error description, which determines whether the outcome is classified as 'Good' or 'Bad'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccea04d305753de718ec8196bbb4d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-658b2c72d54f5635fe092e1d409216ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5291e8c8d87427d45354665dbecd763b</data>
