    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Program and Error Description are paired inputs used together to assess the student’s understanding — the program shows execution, the description shows meta-awareness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description is derived from an analysis of the student's program, identifying logical or syntactic flaws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program and error description are paired inputs used together to assess the student’s understanding, where the error description contextualizes potential flaws or correctness in the program."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-004ef4fc2ed15929827169f862ebd088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb545e46aabe21f67de0b3e0da010f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5291e8c8d87427d45354665dbecd763b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
