    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The error description directly indicates which knowledge points the student misunderstood or applied incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description explicitly or implicitly references specific knowledge points to indicate where the student succeeded or failed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The presence or absence of specific knowledge points in the error description determines the accuracy of the student’s self-assessment and the resulting mastery level."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description is analyzed to identify which knowledge points the student understood or misunderstood, directly linking their reflection to the assessment criteria."</data>
