    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Enumeration_and_Sorting enables the greedy assignment strategy by ordering intervals, making the Greedy approach possible — the two knowledge points are interdependent in the student’s solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration_and_Sorting 为 Greedy 策略提供了基础，通过排序实现元素配对，从而贪心地最小化操作总和。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Sorting the enumerated candidates by cost enables the greedy selection of the best candidate, a correct high-level strategy undermined by poor enumeration."&lt;SEP&gt;"排序是贪心策略的基础，学生通过排序后选取中位数候选值来贪心最小化操作数，二者在解法中紧密耦合。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-491b51dba2652c663fb7ffdf86cf09c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-641cef19afae4c546ffa6d06efbe027f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545cb269f14609feb72aa54e1397a88f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e71bd5f93d74a52e913bc532b569f8b</data>
