      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem requires generating a valid permutation under constraints, which is solved using sorting by left bounds and greedy assignment—directly relying on Enumeration_and_Sorting knowledge point."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem requires generating a valid permutation under constraints, which is solved using sorting by range boundaries and greedy enumeration — key aspects of Enumeration_and_Sorting."</data>
