    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;小苯&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 applies enumeration and sorting in the solution by sorting the array and iterating over elements to find valid pairs, demonstrating correct application of this knowledge point."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 implements enumeration over divisors and sorts the array to efficiently count valid pairs, demonstrating application of this knowledge point."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 uses sorting and nested iteration to enumerate pairs, showing attempted application of enumeration and sorting — but the logic for counting valid pairs is flawed."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯's solution sorts the array and uses enumeration over divisors to find valid pairs, demonstrating application of enumeration and sorting knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯's solution sorts the array and enumerates pairs via nested loops, showing application of enumeration and sorting to reduce redundant computations."</data>
