    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;HASH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">48.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Hash enables efficient enumeration by reducing the search space through frequency-based counting, enhancing the sorting and iteration process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hash is used in conjunction with enumeration to avoid reprocessing duplicate values, optimizing the sorting-based enumeration approach."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hashing (via cnt[]) accelerates enumeration by allowing constant-time lookup of complementary values during divisor iteration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The hash-based frequency array (cnt[]) is used in conjunction with sorted array traversal to efficiently count valid XOR-GCD pairs."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生先用哈希统计频率，再对频率进行排序，两者协同实现对元素出现次数的高效分析，是解题流程中的关键依赖。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Hash tables can be used to optimize enumeration by avoiding duplicates or enabling fast access during sorting."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-96a5a90585cd28544500c57e9d99022f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5142f619b26ce2cf4daf48d5ff07040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea155f37a5b0dedc89550cd089887dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-174ed570d15fd77291044f9539d0d3fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2545f92f06987124bd5e6a93af6ed19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f879cfc3be84369f4b6a9265d25a34</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
