    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student uses enumeration of candidate medians and sorting to determine the optimal transformation targets for achieving the '双生数组' state, directly linking this knowledge point to solving the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的定义要求对元素进行统计和排序以验证两种值的出现次数，排序是实现该概念检测和构造的基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的构造要求两种元素数量相等，排序后将前半与后半配对是达成该目标的高效方式，直接依赖 Enumeration_and_Sorting。"&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的求解需要枚举可能的两种目标值并排序候选解，学生程序中枚举4个中位数候选并排序，直接对应此知识点。"&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的构造依赖于将数组排序后划分为两组等频元素，Enumeration_and_Sorting 是达成该目标的必要步骤。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8bd847ee4bb18545e7523cd52f77dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1e600afd93ca192eb8ffc6cb8cc292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f71d63af657c5508ccdab07ea6c18f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e71bd5f93d74a52e913bc532b569f8b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">65.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Enumerating the positions of '1's and sorting them to target locations is a prerequisite step for simulating their movement via adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration of '1' positions drives the simulation steps, as each found '1' triggers a sequence of swaps to sort it into place."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student uses enumeration of four candidate medians and simulates the cost for each, combining both knowledge points to test possible solutions, but the enumeration is flawed due to index-value confusion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Simulation of adjacent swaps depends on enumeration to locate each '1' and determine its target, making enumeration a foundational component of the simulation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation involves enumerating over grid elements in a sequential manner to compute diagonal sums, making enumeration a core component of the simulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation uses enumeration to check every cell in the grid for conditions, which is essential to the correctness of the logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration via nested loops is the mechanism by which the simulation explores all matrix elements to evaluate conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration of array indices is the mechanism used to perform the simulation, but the student’s enumeration does not correctly mirror the intended problem logic, leading to simulation failure."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-641cef19afae4c546ffa6d06efbe027f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd2069b32b3ad84665dc044ac51f497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6c899f823d305879d17d86ecb45a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc13f3cc7f5b3af45d1ad4e19c942b49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03aa5b650266df4503cc3ab5342d2ee1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0578a35809a5b5cc19052ef0d6078e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e161f201c8def8f1d7dafe61f19dc1</data>
