    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">160.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Enumeration_and_Sorting is a necessary conceptual step to identify and relocate all '1's to the top-left quadrant to form the '好矩阵'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enumeration of matrix positions and the reordering of '1's toward the top-left quadrant is a form of spatial sorting to achieve the '好矩阵' configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 requires the precise enumeration of '1' positions and their sorting into the top-left quadrant, so Enumeration_and_Sorting is structurally necessary to define and achieve this target."&lt;SEP&gt;The construction of 好矩阵 (Hao Ju Zhen) fundamentally relies on the technique of Enumeration_and_Sorting, which is a foundational requirement for achieving its strict structural definition. To form a 好矩阵, all occurrences of '1's in the input matrix must first be systematically enumerated to identify their current positions. Subsequently, these '1's must be sorted and repositioned with precision into the top-left quadrant of the matrix, ensuring that the final configuration satisfies the requirement of concentrating all '1's within this fixed region. This process involves not only identifying the source coordinates of each '1' but also determining and ordering their target placements to minimize movement and achieve optimal alignment. While some descriptions mention the enumeration of both '1's and '0's, the core operational focus remains on the relocation and sorting of '1's, as '0's serve as placeholders in the remaining quadrants. The enumeration step ensures complete awareness of the initial distribution, while the sorting step enforces a deterministic, ordered rearrangement that guarantees the top-left quadrant is filled precisely and exclusively with '1's. Thus, Enumeration_and_Sorting is not merely a helpful method but an essential, non-negotiable procedure for constructing 好矩阵, as it enables the systematic transformation of any initial state into the required target configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;"To construct 好矩阵, one must enumerate all '1's outside the top-left quadrant and sort or prioritize their movement to the target region, making enumeration and sorting critical to reaching this structure."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2f6856b0857c340a0a736de1a173d764&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3655e2f9ff0ad97a40cbb5e827990f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa396a1e574085f91576e710eaa87a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd98342443974d00046bbc62a7ae1f50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6247e0c09a8368e71631b60beb57a0bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7ab6a56958755965617c1147a388579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e4565bd13d40f1df7dd3737e1885f10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5448b6a1f2bc39e282db3976a922f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e8638ebdbdf00618c1aeeebfe5c017&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fedfd8dc5bb3022a25bfcc5fe660373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e400700ddd5c7295c464b96b4722c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd2069b32b3ad84665dc044ac51f497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7505a8a58bc2ae0a0f49a4f4a99ca45c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a436263dc7f42b9debfea46e9464a98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf668f21e72d8570408d55048adcda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246822371b4a88626131f0e16a7011d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfb1c8a2a7c5ab2297cc1bce76d8554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cd35d2da3ec05d7b2e867504beda050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076bbe3986a1ac2be6fa34ff30ec0d80</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
