    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">131.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Control structures (for loops and if conditions) are used to implement the simulation of grid validation, but their incorrect nesting and flag logic undermine the simulation’s accuracy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Control structures are used to implement the simulation logic; the failure in control flow directly undermines the simulation’s correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Simulation algorithms rely heavily on control structures to model step-by-step system behavior over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structures in the student's code are meant to support the simulation of determinant calculation, but due to incorrect logic, the simulation fails to meet the mathematical requirement of determinant = x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nested for-loops and conditional branches in the control structure are used to perform the simulation of cost calculation, but incorrect indexing (using array values as indices) corrupts the simulation logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation logic is governed by control structures (loops and conditionals) that dictate when and how swaps occur to move '1's into the correct quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Simulation of adjacent swaps relies on control structures (loops, conditionals) to track positions and manage the step-by-step transformation of the matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"The while and for loops (control structures) are used to simulate the diagonal traversal of a 2D array, making control flow essential to the simulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structures (if-statements, loops) are used to implement a simulation of grid constraints, but the improper scoping of the flag variable undermines the simulation's accuracy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation logic relies on control structures (if-statements, flags, loops) to determine conditions under which the flag is set, indicating that control flow governs the simulation's behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation relies on nested control structures (for-loops and if-statements) to traverse and evaluate the grid conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student attempts simulation using control structures (loops and conditionals), but misapplies them, showing interdependence between these two knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structures (loops and conditionals) enable the simulation to iterate and evaluate matrix conditions, forming its foundational mechanism."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's use of control structures (loops and conditionals) enables the simulation of matrix condition checks."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-45490059e4c46d4b5d35da604f2ccf3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7ab6a56958755965617c1147a388579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52543ca7da1d4a9ba677841843749191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-641cef19afae4c546ffa6d06efbe027f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3be5d2e7b4cdc0624a78ec7eea0965b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6c899f823d305879d17d86ecb45a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bef65f0a968ef3a0849ac39bbd081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc13f3cc7f5b3af45d1ad4e19c942b49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba8082d2aafc7f8fc80c51b5821c2ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e13487940003c734226499e5fddc01ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80238b5fffb44ffa0ed8e2b2ac553255&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0578a35809a5b5cc19052ef0d6078e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e161f201c8def8f1d7dafe61f19dc1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
