    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">39.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The code simulates the effect of converting every array element to each candidate median value, evaluating which transformation leads to the desired '双生数组' configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的构造本质上是模拟每个元素向目标值的变换过程，学生模拟了代价但目标值错误，导致整体模拟无效。"&lt;SEP&gt;"将数组转换为双生数组的过程需要模拟不同目标值组合下的操作代价，学生的代码通过循环计算绝对差实现了这一模拟。"&lt;SEP&gt;"将原数组转换为双生数组需模拟每个元素向目标值的调整过程，学生通过循环计算代价模拟了这一过程。"&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的转换过程本质上是模拟每个元素向目标值靠拢的操作代价，Simulation 是学生尝试实现该过程的方法，但逻辑错误导致失败。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8bd847ee4bb18545e7523cd52f77dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1e600afd93ca192eb8ffc6cb8cc292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-491b51dba2652c663fb7ffdf86cf09c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f71d63af657c5508ccdab07ea6c18f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Simulation may be used to test or validate the outcomes of a Greedy algorithm by stepping through its decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Simulation of adjacent swaps is typically implemented using a greedy approach to minimize steps, making these two knowledge points closely interdependent in the solution strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation of total operations for each candidate median is followed by a greedy selection of the minimum, which is logically sound but applied to invalid candidates, leading to incorrect results."&lt;SEP&gt;"贪心策略试图避免显式模拟每个操作，而是通过数学公式估算最小操作数，是模拟的抽象替代，但因假设不当而失败。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Simulation problems often employ Greedy strategies to make step-wise decisions that reflect real-world behavior without exhaustive search."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-641cef19afae4c546ffa6d06efbe027f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5142f619b26ce2cf4daf48d5ff07040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-174ed570d15fd77291044f9539d0d3fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e323f51098edcf47a15008673b8c96b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03aa5b650266df4503cc3ab5342d2ee1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">245.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Simulation is the process used to achieve the '好矩阵' state by performing adjacent swaps on the initial matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;The entity "好矩阵" (Hǎo Jǔzhèn) refers to a target state that must be achieved through the simulation of adjacent swaps within a matrix, typically composed of '1's and '0's. This target state is defined by a specific configuration, often requiring the repositioning of '1's into the top-left quadrant of the matrix to form an optimal or desired structure. The process of achieving "好矩阵" is fundamentally dependent on simulation — specifically, the step-by-step, procedural modeling of adjacent element swaps, where each swap is explicitly enacted and tracked to progressively transform the initial matrix into the target configuration. 

Simulation is not merely an auxiliary tool but the core, indispensable, and only feasible computational method for realizing "好矩阵"; analytical shortcuts or direct manipulation are insufficient or impossible in this context. Every description consistently affirms that the transformation from the initial matrix to the "好矩阵" state is accomplished exclusively through iterative, physical-like modeling of adjacent swaps, making simulation the defining mechanism of the entire process. The Chinese and English descriptions align in emphasizing that this is a deliberate, incremental procedure, where each operation is designed to bring the matrix closer to the target structure. Thus, "好矩阵" and "Simulation" are inextricably linked: "好矩阵" is the objective, and simulation is the necessary, procedural, and primary method by which this objective is attained.&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is the target state that the simulation must achieve by systematically moving '1's via adjacent swaps, making the simulation the mechanism to realize this defined goal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2f6856b0857c340a0a736de1a173d764&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3655e2f9ff0ad97a40cbb5e827990f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa396a1e574085f91576e710eaa87a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd98342443974d00046bbc62a7ae1f50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6247e0c09a8368e71631b60beb57a0bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7ab6a56958755965617c1147a388579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84eba6b6eff8493a43c7fd384677acc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e4565bd13d40f1df7dd3737e1885f10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5448b6a1f2bc39e282db3976a922f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e8638ebdbdf00618c1aeeebfe5c017&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fedfd8dc5bb3022a25bfcc5fe660373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e400700ddd5c7295c464b96b4722c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6ae6c968489276c8bb614966bd0f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410c9ee9aeea30ffa768d055e5128a0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf205584a12138b86107f950268b071f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd2069b32b3ad84665dc044ac51f497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97b7273e9cd49bbbd3b2dcef862908b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7505a8a58bc2ae0a0f49a4f4a99ca45c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f273c58705b21c2ef1fc6c43ff66b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a436263dc7f42b9debfea46e9464a98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf668f21e72d8570408d55048adcda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246822371b4a88626131f0e16a7011d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfb1c8a2a7c5ab2297cc1bce76d8554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60231925bd696a34976f33351b0f3da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cd35d2da3ec05d7b2e867504beda050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076bbe3986a1ac2be6fa34ff30ec0d80</data>
