      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Control structures enable the systematic execution of swap operations needed to transform the matrix into the '好矩阵' state."&lt;SEP&gt;"The constraints of '好矩阵' (fixed quadrant positions, even dimensions) require precise control logic to ensure elements are moved only to correct locations, which the student's code fails to enforce. "&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 solution must use control structures to iterate over matrix positions and conditionally execute swaps until the target is reached."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 transformation requires iterative control structures to check completion and trigger swaps until the target configuration is reached."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵的约束条件（如偶数维度、四象限划分）要求程序使用控制结构进行区域判断和边界检查，确保操作合法。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Correct control flow is needed to ensure '1's are placed only in the top-left quadrant without overwriting or misplacing them."&lt;SEP&gt;"Control_Structure governs the logic flow required to traverse the matrix and apply swaps in the correct order to achieve the '好矩阵' configuration."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6247e0c09a8368e71631b60beb57a0bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f6856b0857c340a0a736de1a173d764&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5448b6a1f2bc39e282db3976a922f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf668f21e72d8570408d55048adcda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60231925bd696a34976f33351b0f3da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e400700ddd5c7295c464b96b4722c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6ae6c968489276c8bb614966bd0f46</data>
