      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A binary search could have been used to find the optimal target value more efficiently than enumeration, but the student chose a greedy enumeration approach instead, missing a more optimal algorithmic technique."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy 解法依赖于中位数的最优性，而 Binary_Search 可用于高效寻找该中位数，学生尝试近似但错误实现，显示两者在理论上相关但实践中误用。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy and Binary_Search are both optimization techniques often combined in problems requiring efficient selection from sorted data under constraints."</data>
