      <data key="d4">"The definition of a valid permutation in '井然有序之窗' relies on using exactly the integers from 1 to n, making this range a foundational constraint of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem event '井然有序之窗' requires constructing a permutation using exactly the integers from 1 to n, making this range foundational to the solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"井然有序之窗 requires the permutation to use all integers from 1 to n exactly once, making this range a necessary condition for correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The range 1 \sim n defines the valid universe of values for the permutation in the '井然有序之窗' problem, forming the core constraint for validity."</data>
