    <edge source="&quot;GAME_THEORY&quot;" target="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Game_Theory provides the analytical framework to evaluate optimal play and the impact of the two-move privilege on the game's outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"The tic-tac-toe game in this context is a classic Game_Theory problem, where the addition of a two-move privilege alters the Nash equilibrium and requires analysis of move sequences and counter-strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The tic-tac-toe game with the two-move privilege is a variant analyzed through game theory to determine if the first player has a forced win under optimal play."</data>
