    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m is the target 可爱度 that string t must achieve, directly linking t’s structure to the required output condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是字符串 t 的目标可爱度，要求 t 必须满足存在长度为 m 的连续子串与不连续子序列相等，是评估 t 是否合格的关键标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;小写字母&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串 t 仅由小写字母构成，字符集的有限性限制了重复模式的生成方式，直接影响可爱度能否达到 m。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;连续子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"t is the string from which the contiguous substring is extracted as part of evaluating its 可爱度."&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串是字符串 t 的一部分，其存在性与长度决定了 t 的可爱度是否能达到 m，是 t 的内在属性之一。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"t is the string from which the non-contiguous subsequence is extracted as part of evaluating its 可爱度."&lt;SEP&gt;"不连续子序列是字符串 t 中非连续但按序选取的字符组合，其存在性与结构决定了 t 是否满足可爱度定义。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 37-2&quot;" target="&quot;ORIGINAL ENTITY EXTRACTION PROMPT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID: 37-2 likely corresponds to a specific submission that was processed using the original entity extraction prompt, linking the record to the evaluation framework."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-40dcea99152c33d48a952a30c8a3cbb0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL ENTITY EXTRACTION PROMPT&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT'S PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's program is designed to implement or respond to the original entity extraction prompt, making it the foundational instruction for the solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's program is designed to implement or respond to the original entity extraction prompt, using it as a guide for identifying entities in text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's program is designed to implement the original entity extraction prompt, using it as a guideline for identifying entities in text."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fbb5cdbfd30be9e287fa0c7b6a106958&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466f0469322efc625bdf0793f2afb8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40dcea99152c33d48a952a30c8a3cbb0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL ENTITY EXTRACTION PROMPT&quot;" target="&quot;DIFFERENT SUBMISSIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Each different submission is evaluated against the same original entity extraction prompt to maintain standardized assessment criteria."</data>
