      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL ENTITY EXTRACTION PROMPT&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 39-2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID: 39-2 is a specific instance of a submission that was processed using the original entity extraction prompt, linking the record to the instructional framework."</data>
