    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT'S PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;DIFFERENT SUBMISSIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Each different submission contains a unique student's program, which is evaluated independently based on how well it adheres to the prompt."</data>
