    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DIFFERENT SUBMISSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SAME PROBLEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Different submissions are responses to the same problem, enabling standardized evaluation of how various students approach identical entity extraction tasks."</data>
