      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The program is designed to demonstrate the student's grasp of specific knowledge points, with its structure and logic reflecting their understanding or confusion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program is evaluated against the knowledge points to determine whether the student correctly applied each relevant concept."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-44c667d557d4fb1e9f0b759d48acec31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18ae858b750790591a327c7d142473ef</data>
