    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;N行N列01矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The好矩阵 is the target state derived from the initial n行n列01矩阵 through a series of operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"n行n列01矩阵是待转换的初始状态，好矩阵是目标状态，二者通过相邻字符交换操作建立转换关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵是n行n列01矩阵经过一系列相邻交换操作后应达到的目标状态，二者是输入与目标的对应关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9dd2069b32b3ad84665dc044ac51f497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf205584a12138b86107f950268b071f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;N 行 N 列 01 矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">70.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n 行 n 列 01 矩阵是待转化的初始状态，而‘好矩阵’是其目标状态，二者构成问题中的输入与输出的转换关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 行 n 列 01 矩阵是待转换的初始状态，好矩阵是目标状态，二者通过相邻字符交换操作建立转化关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"目标是将原始的 01 矩阵通过相邻交换操作转化为好矩阵，二者是操作前后的状态关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘n 行 n 列 01 矩阵’是需要通过相邻交换操作被转换为目标状态‘好矩阵’的初始输入，二者构成问题中的输入-目标关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"初始的 n×n 01 矩阵需要通过相邻字符交换操作，转化为满足特定区域分布条件的‘好矩阵’事件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"目标是通过相邻交换操作，将给定的 01 矩阵转换为满足特定结构的'好矩阵'，二者是输入与目标输出的对应关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的 01 矩阵需要通过一系列相邻交换操作被转换为目标状态‘好矩阵’，二者是初始状态与目标状态的对应关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c84eba6b6eff8493a43c7fd384677acc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c45ae6d217837b0ec49eaf31b3f5388&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246822371b4a88626131f0e16a7011d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cd35d2da3ec05d7b2e867504beda050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cdb2064474980b06343cd68cff259c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97b7273e9cd49bbbd3b2dcef862908b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6ae6c968489276c8bb614966bd0f46</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;N行N列矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"好矩阵是n行n列矩阵的一种特殊构造形式，要求矩阵满足特定的分区和字符分布规则，因此二者是目标状态与原始状态的对应关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a588519a4b977de5b0bcf8ded42f8642</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;01矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"01矩阵是需要通过一系列相邻交换操作被转换为目标状态‘好矩阵’的输入，二者是问题中的初始状态与目标状态关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e4b814718769c7c5ff34fd8d9992e16</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;LEFT-UPPER REGION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The good matrix event requires the left-upper region to be entirely composed of '1's, making this region a critical structural component of the target state."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7c45ae6d217837b0ec49eaf31b3f5388</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER THREE REGIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The good matrix event requires the other three regions to be entirely '0's, defining the complementary constraint to the left-upper region."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7c45ae6d217837b0ec49eaf31b3f5388</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;ADJACENT SWAP OPERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The adjacent swap operation is the only mechanism available to transform the input matrix into the good matrix state, making it the essential procedural link between input and target."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7c45ae6d217837b0ec49eaf31b3f5388</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;N 行 N 列矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"‘n 行 n 列矩阵’是需要通过操作（交换相邻字符）被转换为‘好矩阵’的初始状态，二者是变换前后的对应关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c5e8638ebdbdf00618c1aeeebfe5c017</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 42-1&quot;" target="&quot;2025-01-21 17:27:43&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The timestamp 2025-01-21 17:27:43 is directly associated with Record ID: 42-1 as the moment the student submission occurred, linking the event to its temporal context."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-44c667d557d4fb1e9f0b759d48acec31</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;GOOD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Good: [description] is an evaluation outcome directly tied to a specific Knowledge Point, indicating correct understanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Good: [description]' format indicates mastery of specific knowledge points, used to affirm understanding where no errors are reported."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Good: [description]' label is assigned to knowledge points that the student demonstrated correct understanding of, based on the absence of errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Good: [description]' format explicitly links a student’s correct response to the specific knowledge points they have mastered."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-44c667d557d4fb1e9f0b759d48acec31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004ef4fc2ed15929827169f862ebd088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466447976916918cad297fdac172adb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f29586db94ae4094fb3286e4239680fd</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;BAD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">42.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Bad: [description] is an evaluation outcome directly tied to a specific Knowledge Point, indicating incorrect or incomplete understanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Bad: [description]' format is used to identify which knowledge points the student misunderstood, linking error descriptions directly to specific learning objectives."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Bad: [description]' label directly relates to missing or misunderstood Knowledge Points that were expected in the student's response."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Bad: [description]' label is assigned to knowledge points where the student's error description reveals misunderstanding or lack of knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Bad: [description]' format identifies which knowledge points the student failed to grasp, based on the error detailed in the description."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4107cad195311f65a1ddf5c1465e753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004ef4fc2ed15929827169f862ebd088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c667d557d4fb1e9f0b759d48acec31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f29586db94ae4094fb3286e4239680fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466447976916918cad297fdac172adb1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;EVALUATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The evaluation process directly applies the list of knowledge points to judge the student’s performance, using the program and error description as data sources."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb545e46aabe21f67de0b3e0da010f7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;POINTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Points in the list correspond to the knowledge points that must be evaluated against the student's program and error description."&lt;SEP&gt;"Points in the list correspond to the knowledge points used to evaluate the student's understanding."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5fa51ab7e65d356229972d6750fbc73e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4db67f6f26be9e4b4ab88e308dd16a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;CORRECT: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Correct: [description]' label indicates the student has accurately addressed one or more Knowledge Points in their submission."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4107cad195311f65a1ddf5c1465e753</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT SUBMISSION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Submission is evaluated against the list of Knowledge Points to determine which concepts the student understands or misunderstands."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-004ef4fc2ed15929827169f862ebd088</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;GOOD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Good' event directly reflects the student's mastery of the knowledge points, as it is triggered when those points are correctly applied."&lt;SEP&gt;"When Knowledge Points are not mentioned in an error description, they are inferred as understood, contributing to a 'Good' classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"When knowledge points are not mentioned in an error description, the 'Good' indicator implies the student has mastered those points."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d435920a0aa88626e8ac90d92c72f6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aee1cb5b4db6b902a5def2f1b55fc26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-174472b84d2963740d25777960a64885</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;BAD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"If knowledge points are referenced in an error description, the 'Bad' indicator signals the student lacks understanding of those specific points."&lt;SEP&gt;"When Knowledge Points are mentioned in an error description, they are inferred as misunderstood, contributing to a 'Bad' classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Bad' event indicates a failure to demonstrate mastery of one or more knowledge points, as revealed by the error description."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d435920a0aa88626e8ac90d92c72f6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aee1cb5b4db6b902a5def2f1b55fc26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-174472b84d2963740d25777960a64885</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOOD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 73-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID: 73-1 may contain a 'Good: [description]' entry as part of its evaluation, linking the specific submission to demonstrated understanding."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f29586db94ae4094fb3286e4239680fd</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOOD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATIONAL ASSESSMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Good: [description]' format is a core component of the educational assessment framework for evaluating student understanding."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6be452c5c1988ad6ddd796f64200a752</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BAD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 71-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Bad: [description]' format is applied to this specific record to document the student’s incorrect response and associated error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1a15e660cbb80bfae0b9863f969116c3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BAD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;" target="&quot;[RECORD ID: 71-1, TIMESTAMP: 2025-01-23 16:51:58]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The composite metadata event triggers or is annotated with the 'Bad: [description]' feedback format to evaluate the student’s understanding."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1a15e660cbb80bfae0b9863f969116c3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BAD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT SUBMISSION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A student submission may be labeled with 'Bad: [description]' when the error description indicates incorrect understanding or mistakes in the response."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4107cad195311f65a1ddf5c1465e753</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BAD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 73-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID: 73-1 may contain a 'Bad: [description]' entry as part of its evaluation, linking the specific submission to a documented misunderstanding."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f29586db94ae4094fb3286e4239680fd</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BAD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATIONAL ASSESSMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
