    <edge source="&quot;牛可乐&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">189.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐作为问题提出者，定义了‘字符串外串’事件中所涉及的‘可爱度’概念与构造要求，是该事件的核心设计者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐作为问题提出者，定义了‘字符串外串’这一事件所涉及的数学概念和求解目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐提出了与‘字符串外串’相关的数学问题，定义了可爱度并设计了构造性挑战，是该事件的发起者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一算法问题的提出者和定义者，直接关联该事件的起源与内容。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一问题的提出者和定义者，该事件围绕其提出的可爱度概念展开。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一算法问题的提出者和设计者，直接关联该事件的起源和内容。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一算法问题的提出者和定义者，直接关联该事件的起源和内容。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一问题的提出者，定义了其核心概念与要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一问题的提出者和定义者，直接关联该事件的起源和内容。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一算法问题的提出者和定义者，直接关联该事件的创建与背景。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐是‘字符串外串’这一算法问题的定义者和提出者，直接关联问题的核心概念。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐作为问题提出者，定义了‘字符串外串’这一算法事件的核心概念与判定规则。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f9fb229ccaa906b2924ad98647d19313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c5a9f768d5896586a40aa9a5d5e578d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-304a22c33987a0af2f7be4a2bf524b1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fa125bb3155fa56767ea43a710e6a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f7b94d5736abea4b1f3639f0bda773f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f9a3d5c32f41f88e9433f1e6a2e55a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49b83f56a940f8f89dfbd7fb5630b525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad12dbd91d84d77d978a49fdce06b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baad8f7b48afed8fdda54dc328952cb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;牛可乐&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐 specifies that the string must have可爱度 exactly equal to m, making m a central target value in the problem's condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在问题中定义 m 作为期望可爱度，是判断字符串 t 是否存在的核心目标值。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在问题中定义了 m 作为可爱度的目标值，是判断字符串是否符合条件的核心约束。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f9fb229ccaa906b2924ad98647d19313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f7b94d5736abea4b1f3639f0bda773f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-304a22c33987a0af2f7be4a2bf524b1a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;牛可乐&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐 is the originator of the concept of 可爱度, defining its mathematical criterion and problem context."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the originator of the concept of 可爱度, which is the core metric of the problem he designed."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;牛可乐&quot;" target="&quot;A.CPP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐设计的问题被学生通过a.cpp程序尝试解答，但程序存在语法错误，表明学生对问题的理解存在实现层面的缺陷。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;牛可乐&quot;" target="&quot;字符串可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐是‘字符串可爱度’这一核心算法概念的定义者，直接构建了本题的数学模型。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;灰色砖块&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"灰色砖块包围或邻接蓝色极大连通块，其敲碎是触发掉落的前提，两者构成直接的物理隔离关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块的掉落依赖于其是否与灰色砖块共边，敲碎灰色砖块是使其脱离的必要条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块的掉落依赖于其是否与灰色砖块存在共边，敲碎灰色砖块是使其掉落的必要条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块的掉落依赖于与其共边的灰色砖块被敲碎，灰色砖块是实现其掉落的必要操作对象。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;蓝色砖块&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"蓝色极大连通块由多个蓝色砖块通过四连通关系组成，蓝色砖块是构成该事件的基本元素。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色砖块通过四连通关系聚合形成蓝色极大连通块，是其组成元素。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块由多个蓝色砖块通过四连通方式构成，蓝色砖块是其基本组成单元。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;四连通&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"四连通规则决定了哪些蓝色砖块属于同一连通块，是构建蓝色极大连通块的结构基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"四连通规则是定义蓝色极大连通块的核心机制，决定了哪些蓝色砖块属于同一连通块。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块的定义依赖于四连通规则，只有上下左右相邻的蓝色砖块才能构成同一连通块。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块的定义依赖于四连通规则，只有通过上下左右四个方向连接的蓝色砖块才能构成一个连通块。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;共边&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"共边关系决定了蓝色极大连通块是否与灰色砖块接触，从而决定其能否自然掉落，是问题判断条件的关键。"&lt;SEP&gt;"共边关系用于判断蓝色极大连通块是否与灰色砖块接触，决定其能否完好掉落，是关键判定条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块是否能掉落，完全取决于其是否与灰色砖块存在共边，共边是判断掉落条件的关键标准。"&lt;SEP&gt;"蓝色极大连通块是否能掉落，取决于其是否与灰色砖块存在共边关系，共边是触发掉落条件的关键判断依据。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;边界&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"位于边界上的蓝色极大连通块受特殊掉落规则约束，边界位置影响其是否需要额外敲碎砖块。"&lt;SEP&gt;"当蓝色极大连通块位于矩阵边界时，其掉落条件被放宽，无需考虑外部支撑，边界直接影响连通块的处理策略。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"蓝色极大连通块是矩阵中特定砖块的连通子集，其存在和掉落条件完全依赖于矩阵的结构和砖块颜色分布。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;悬空&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"对于位于边界的蓝色极大连通块，悬空状态被忽略，这是问题中对边界情况的特殊处理规则。"&lt;SEP&gt;"悬空概念被特别排除在边界蓝色极大连通块的掉落条件之外，说明该规则是问题设定中的特例处理。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;程序段&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"程序段中的 BFS 算法旨在识别和遍历蓝色极大连通块，是实现问题求解的计算工具。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;砖块矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"蓝色极大连通块存在于砖块矩阵中，是矩阵中蓝色砖块的连通子集，矩阵结构决定了连通块的形态和位置。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色极大连通块&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve() 函数的目标是计算使蓝色极大连通块掉落所需的最少灰色砖块数，是该事件的算法实现主体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;灰色砖块&quot;" target="&quot;(I,J)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) 坐标系统用于精确标识每一个灰色砖块的位置，是计算敲碎策略的基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;灰色砖块&quot;" target="&quot;敲碎&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"敲碎操作直接作用于灰色砖块，是改变矩阵结构以达成掉落目标的唯一方式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"敲碎是作用于灰色砖块的唯一操作，目的是切断蓝色极大连通块与外界的连接。"&lt;SEP&gt;"敲碎是针对灰色砖块执行的唯一操作，是使蓝色极大连通块脱离的必要手段。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;灰色砖块&quot;" target="&quot;砖块矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"灰色砖块是砖块矩阵中的一部分，其分布决定了哪些区域可被敲碎以触发蓝色连通块的掉落。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;灰色砖块&quot;" target="&quot;共边&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"灰色砖块通过与蓝色砖块共边，构成对蓝色极大连通块的包围或支撑，是决定掉落所需敲碎数量的直接因素。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;蓝色砖块&quot;" target="&quot;(I,J)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) 坐标系统用于定位每一个蓝色砖块，是构建蓝色极大连通块的必要信息。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N \TIMES M 矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;程序段&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"程序段通过二维数组 a[600][600] 和 vis[600][600] 表示 n \times m 矩阵，是其在代码中的具体实现。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;程序段&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"程序段使用坐标对 {x, y} 表示矩阵中的位置，对应问题中的 (i,j) 符号系统，实现位置映射。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;砖块矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"砖块矩阵的结构通过 (i,j) 坐标系统进行精确描述，每个位置的砖块类型（灰/蓝）由其坐标决定。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29857b4f8282de50e14a24cfb03c96db</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze selects any coordinate (i,j) on the grid map to activate Dragon's Breath, making (i,j) the input point for her ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze selects coordinates (i,j) as targets for Dragon's Breath, making (i,j) the fundamental input for her attack strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze targets specific (i,j) coordinates on the grid to unleash Dragon's Breath and maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze targets specific (i,j) coordinates on the grid to maximize the effect of Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16239776332d396b902352ee025093cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) is the coordinate system that maps positions within the Grid Map, enabling precise location of monsters and flame propagation."&lt;SEP&gt;"(i,j) is the coordinate system used to index every cell within the Grid Map."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is composed of all possible (i,j) coordinates, where i ranges from 1 to n and j ranges from 1 to m, forming its discrete spatial structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"(i,j) is the coordinate system used to index every cell within the Grid Map."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0abd9d06cc1108aa2d33d0668e3a2f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) is the coordinate key that indexes the monster count a_{i,j} in the grid, directly linking position to data value."&lt;SEP&gt;"The monster count a_{i,j} at coordinate (i,j) directly contributes to the total damage of Dragon's Breath when (i,j) is the target."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-16239776332d396b902352ee025093cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;四连通&quot;" target="&quot;程序段&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"程序段中 dx[] 和 dy[] 数组定义了上下左右四个方向，直接实现了四连通的遍历逻辑。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;悬空&quot;" target="&quot;边界&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"悬空规则仅适用于位于边界上的蓝色极大连通块，是边界条件处理的特例，简化了掉落判断逻辑。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f16e2ed285bc34ab93459eb373d468a7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;敲碎&quot;" target="&quot;掉落&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"敲碎灰色砖块是实现蓝色极大连通块掉落的必要操作，两者构成因果关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e26cd87db8b5889ee98f45461f05c972</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;敲碎&quot;" target="&quot;程序段&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"程序段的目标是计算最少敲碎的灰色砖块数，其算法设计围绕最小化敲碎操作展开。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae30464427d8e7c597e77124283292d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;GRID SEARCH PROBLEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm is the core method employed to solve the Grid Search Problem by systematically exploring connected components and evaluating boundary conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS Algorithm is the core method used to solve the Grid Search Problem by exploring connected components in a 2D grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86f2da20705ac92182e4cb2383023c8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm uses m to define the horizontal grid boundary for valid coordinate checks during traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;A[VX][VY]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm reads values from the a[vx][vy] grid to determine traversable nodes (1) and boundary cells (0)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;VIS[UX][UY]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm relies on the vis[ux][uy] array to avoid revisiting nodes and ensure correct component counting."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;CNT1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt1 is incremented during BFS to count the size of each connected component, directly influencing the solution's optimality."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;CNT2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt2 is incremented when adjacent cells are 0, used to minimize boundary exposure for the largest component."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;ANS1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans1 stores the maximum component size encountered, guiding the update logic for Min in the BFS algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Min is updated based on cnt2 values when cnt1 matches ans1, making it central to the correctness of the final output."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;CONNECTED COMPONENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm is used to traverse and identify each connected component of 1s in the grid, counting its size (cnt1)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d86f2da20705ac92182e4cb2383023c8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;BOUNDARY COUNT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"During BFS traversal, the algorithm counts adjacent 0 cells (cnt2) as boundary cells, which are used to optimize selection among equally sized components."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d86f2da20705ac92182e4cb2383023c8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;VIS ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The vis array is essential to the BFS Algorithm to avoid revisiting cells and ensure accurate component size and boundary counting."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d86f2da20705ac92182e4cb2383023c8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;GRAPH STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm operates on the implicit Graph Structure formed by the grid's connected cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d513b4e5ac4753a8c4299f06737d9f5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;GRID SEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Grid Search initiates BFS Algorithm for each unvisited land cell to explore connected components."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d513b4e5ac4753a8c4299f06737d9f5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L implemented the BFS Algorithm in their program to solve the number transformation problem, demonstrating an attempt to use systematic search."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72ec471dad6ce28ff96a6fd072638d9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;小L的数学题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm is the method used to attempt solving 小L的数学题, directly linking the computational technique to the problem's solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72ec471dad6ce28ff96a6fd072638d9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID SEARCH PROBLEM&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m defines the grid's column dimension, a critical input for the Grid Search Problem’s spatial constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID SEARCH PROBLEM&quot;" target="&quot;A[VX][VY]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Search Problem requires analyzing the binary grid a[vx][vy] to identify connected components and their boundaries."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID SEARCH PROBLEM&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Min is the required output of the Grid Search Problem, representing the minimum number of adjacent zeros among the largest components."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f47b94be846baff878bf6f6f7085dd36</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串外串事件的核心是使字符串的可爱度恰好等于 m，m 是判定构造成功与否的关键输出目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串事件的核心是使字符串的可爱度恰好等于m，m是衡量构造成功与否的判定阈值."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f9fb229ccaa906b2924ad98647d19313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f7b94d5736abea4b1f3639f0bda773f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;STRING T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"String t must have a 可爱度 exactly equal to m, making m the target value for evaluation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;NO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"当m=1或n-m&gt;26时，学生程序应输出NO，m的值决定是否触发‘NO’的输出条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">42.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map is defined by m columns, making m a critical parameter that constrains the horizontal boundaries of the map."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, determining its horizontal extent."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, constraining the horizontal range over which Dragon's Breath can propagate."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, structuring its horizontal dimension."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, establishing its horizontal dimension and constraining valid coordinate ranges for Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0abd9d06cc1108aa2d33d0668e3a2f58</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;CODE EXECUTION ERROR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m defines the column limit but is not validated, allowing v to exceed array bounds when v++ is applied in loops."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7eae5d00111387ffd168e8ec3f83adc0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable 'm' defines the number of columns in the 2D array 'a', establishing the array's dimensionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the expected column size of array a, but its value is unvalidated, risking array access beyond allocated memory."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7eae5d00111387ffd168e8ec3f83adc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
