    <edge source="&quot;CORRECT ANSWER&quot;" target="&quot;INCORRECT ANSWER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The incorrect answer is directly compared to the correct answer to identify discrepancies, which helps determine the student's mastery of specific knowledge points."</data>
