    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;连续子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"‘字符串外串’事件的核心是构造或判断包含特定长度连续子串的字符串，是解题的直接目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-304a22c33987a0af2f7be4a2bf524b1a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"‘字符串外串’事件要求识别并利用不连续子序列与连续子串的匹配关系，是定义可爱度的关键机制。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-304a22c33987a0af2f7be4a2bf524b1a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;A.CPP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a.cpp是学生为解决‘字符串外串’问题所提交的程序，尽管存在语法错误，但其目标是实现该问题的算法逻辑。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"在字符串可爱度定义中，连续子串与不连续子序列必须完全相等，二者构成问题的核心等价条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串 a 和不连续子序列 b 必须长度相等且内容相同，才能定义字符串的可爱度，二者构成可爱度计算的必要配对关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串与不连续子序列是定义‘可爱度’的两个对称但结构不同的组成部分，必须长度相等且内容一致才能构成有效解。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-304a22c33987a0af2f7be4a2bf524b1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"可爱度 is defined by the existence of a contiguous substring of length k that matches a non-contiguous subsequence of the same length."&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度 is defined by the existence of a contiguous substring of length k, making it a necessary component of the definition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;STRING T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"String t must contain at least one contiguous substring of length m to satisfy the 可爱度 condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;字符串可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串可爱度的定义依赖于存在一个长度为k的连续子串与不连续子序列相等，二者是构成该概念的核心要素。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"可爱度 is defined by the existence of a non-contiguous subsequence of length k that matches a contiguous substring of the same length."&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度 requires a matching non-contiguous subsequence (as uniquely defined) of the same length as the contiguous substring, making it a necessary component of the definition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d67eed4167be71f6d488c596375abffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;STRING T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"String t must contain at least one non-contiguous subsequence of length m that equals a contiguous substring to satisfy the 可爱度 condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c14a39faa60f3b7fe091f2aa3abd4d35</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;字符串可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串可爱度的定义要求一个长度为k的不连续子序列与连续子串相等，二者是等价判定的关键条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ec4fb3453fbb729dbac9f6d54953070e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;B&quot;">
      <data key="d3">59.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a and b are the two binary numbers that must be manipulated to satisfy a⊕b=c, making them directly interdependent in the problem's logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"a and b are the two binary numbers whose XOR result must equal c; they are directly manipulated through operations to achieve the goal."&lt;SEP&gt;"a 和 b 是位运算操作的两个输入变量，它们的异或结果必须等于 c，二者在操作中相互影响。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a 和 b 是可爱度定义中必须相等的两个结构，a 为连续子串，b 为不连续子序列，它们的等价性是问题求解的核心条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a和b是参与异或运算的两个二进制数，它们的每一位组合决定是否需要操作以匹配c。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a and b are the two binary numbers whose bitwise XOR must equal c, making them directly related through the mathematical constraint a⊕b=c."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ed4955719b894156cc66d8c640e8a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dfdf42008b0416959725ff99bf52414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d35334ea05ab1a03cfcf22d7faec2d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a is the source data for sum; without proper initialization of a or correct traversal, sum will contain garbage values."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum is populated from values in a, so its correctness depends entirely on accurate traversal and indexing of a."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7eae5d00111387ffd168e8ec3f83adc0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 2D array 'a' provides the elements that are accumulated into the sum2 array for two distinct diagonal directions."&lt;SEP&gt;"a is the foundational data for sum2; any misstep in accessing a[u][v] directly corrupts sum2’s computed diagonals."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum2 is derived from diagonal traversals of a; any error in u or v propagation corrupts the stored sums."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7eae5d00111387ffd168e8ec3f83adc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SUM1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 2D array 'a' is the source of values that are summed and stored in the sum1 array along specific diagonals."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;U&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable 'u' is used as a row index to access elements of the 2D array 'a' during diagonal traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable 'v' is used as a column index to access elements of the 2D array 'a' during diagonal traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-97fb25c01f1eb3aee703f8014c736f96</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The XOR of a and b must equal c, making c the target state that a must be transformed toward through operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"a 的最终状态必须与 b 配合，使得 a⊕b 的结果等于 c，因此 a 的每一位都直接关联到 c 的对应位。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a与b异或的结果必须等于c，因此a的每一位变化直接影响c的匹配程度。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The value of c is defined as the XOR result of a and b; thus, any change to a directly affects the feasibility of achieving c."&lt;SEP&gt;"a must be manipulated via operations to satisfy the equation a⊕b=c, making it fundamentally related to c as a component of the target."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0dfdf42008b0416959725ff99bf52414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d35334ea05ab1a03cfcf22d7faec2d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;按位异或运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"按位异或运算是定义 a 与 b 之间关系的数学规则，a 的每一位参与该运算以生成目标结果。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;翻转操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是翻转操作的直接作用对象，其每一位可被单独翻转以调整异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a的每一位可被翻转，翻转操作是修改a以满足a⊕b=c的直接手段。"&lt;SEP&gt;"翻转操作直接作用于 a 的每一位，是调整 a 以满足 a⊕b=c 的关键手段。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4aa219dac75bf066df67ce60e89bfb70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;交换操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是交换操作的直接作用对象，其数位可被任意交换以重构异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a的位可被交换以调整其结构，使a⊕b更接近c，降低总成本。"&lt;SEP&gt;"交换操作通过重新排列 a 的位顺序，间接影响 a⊕b 的结果，是优化成本的重要策略。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4aa219dac75bf066df67ce60e89bfb70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y determines the cost of swapping bits within a, affecting whether swapping is preferred over flipping."&lt;SEP&gt;"y is the cost per bit-swap operation on a, linking the cost structure directly to reordering bits in a."&lt;SEP&gt;"y is the cost per bit-swap operation on a, directly linking the cost structure to rearrangements of a's bits."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d35334ea05ab1a03cfcf22d7faec2d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dfdf42008b0416959725ff99bf52414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;位运算教学事件&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a is one of the core binary operands in the problem taught during the bitwise operations lesson."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是构成目标事件a⊕b=c的两个操作数之一，其状态直接影响异或结果是否等于c。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4aa219dac75bf066df67ce60e89bfb70</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L拥有并操作二进制数a，是其所有操作的直接控制者。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4aa219dac75bf066df67ce60e89bfb70</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The XOR of b and a must equal c, making c the target state that b must be transformed toward through operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"b 的最终状态必须与 a 配合，使得 a⊕b 的结果等于 c，因此 b 的每一位都直接关联到 c 的对应位。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b与a异或的结果必须等于c，因此b的每一位变化直接影响c的匹配程度。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The value of c is defined as the XOR result of a and b; thus, any change to b directly affects the feasibility of achieving c."&lt;SEP&gt;"b must be manipulated via operations to satisfy the equation a⊕b=c, making it fundamentally related to c as a component of the target."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0dfdf42008b0416959725ff99bf52414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d35334ea05ab1a03cfcf22d7faec2d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;按位异或运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"按位异或运算是定义 b 与 a 之间关系的数学规则，b 的每一位参与该运算以生成目标结果。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;翻转操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b是翻转操作的直接作用对象，其每一位可被单独翻转以调整异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b的每一位可被翻转，翻转操作是修改b以满足a⊕b=c的直接手段。"&lt;SEP&gt;"翻转操作直接作用于 b 的每一位，是调整 b 以满足 a⊕b=c 的关键手段。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4aa219dac75bf066df67ce60e89bfb70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;交换操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b是交换操作的直接作用对象，其数位可被任意交换以重构异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b的位可被交换以调整其结构，使a⊕b更接近c，降低总成本。"&lt;SEP&gt;"交换操作通过重新排列 b 的位顺序，间接影响 a⊕b 的结果，是优化成本的重要策略。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4aa219dac75bf066df67ce60e89bfb70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1ad26da8e1dd26ea1fab354805adb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd1875a0dbd372cf163954f0bb5a61f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y determines the cost of swapping bits within b, affecting whether swapping is preferred over flipping."&lt;SEP&gt;"y is the cost per bit-swap operation on b, linking the cost structure directly to reordering bits in b."&lt;SEP&gt;"y is the cost per bit-swap operation on b, directly linking the cost structure to rearrangements of b's bits."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d35334ea05ab1a03cfcf22d7faec2d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dfdf42008b0416959725ff99bf52414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;位运算教学事件&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
