    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">56.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to destroy monsters on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to destroy monsters on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, directing it to maximize monster elimination on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, directing it to specific coordinates on the grid to maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to destroy monsters on the grid map."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16239776332d396b902352ee025093cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0abd9d06cc1108aa2d33d0668e3a2f58</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">50.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map by selecting coordinates to deploy Dragon's Breath, making the grid the spatial domain of her action."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map, choosing coordinates to unleash Dragon's Breath and maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map, selecting coordinates to unleash Dragon's Breath and maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map, selecting coordinates to unleash Dragon's Breath and maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates within the Grid Map, selecting coordinates to deploy Dragon's Breath across its cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates within the Grid Map, selecting coordinates to activate Dragon's Breath, making the grid the operational environment for her ability."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16239776332d396b902352ee025093cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0abd9d06cc1108aa2d33d0668e3a2f58</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze's effectiveness depends on the monster counts a_{i,j} at each grid cell to calculate optimal attack positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze's goal is to maximize the sum of a_{i,j} values affected by Dragon's Breath, directly relying on monster counts at each grid cell."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze's goal is to maximize the sum of monsters across diagonal paths defined by a_{i,j} values."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
