      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the namesake of the problem, indicating authorship or association with the problem statement in competitive programming contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the namesake of the problem, indicating authorship or association with this specific computational challenge."</data>
