    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">60.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is a spatial ability that acts upon the Grid Map, destroying monsters along diagonal paths defined by the grid's coordinate system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a spatial ability that affects cells in an 'X' pattern across the Grid Map, with its damage calculation dependent on grid coordinates and monster densities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal lines based on the chosen firing coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal paths based on the targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an attack mechanic that acts upon the Grid Map, destroying monsters along diagonal lines based on the chosen center coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the Grid Map, affecting monsters along diagonal lines across its cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16239776332d396b902352ee025093cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0abd9d06cc1108aa2d33d0668e3a2f58</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X,Y)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(x,y) is the precise target coordinate from which Dragon's Breath is activated, determining the center of the diagonal flame pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is activated at coordinate (x,y), which serves as the center point for the 'X'-shaped flame propagation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is always centered at coordinate (x,y), from which its diagonal flame pattern originates."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X-1,Y-1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">56.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(x-1,y-1) is a direct propagation direction of Dragon's Breath flame, forming one arm of the 'X' pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame extends in the (x-1,y-1) direction diagonally across the grid, destroying monsters along that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates along the (x-1,y-1) direction from its center, destroying monsters in that diagonal line as part of its 'X' shape."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates flame along the (x-1,y-1) diagonal direction, destroying all monsters on that line from the firing point."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates flame along the diagonal direction (x-1,y-1) from the target, destroying all monsters along that line."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x-1,y-1) is a directional extension point of Dragon's Breath flame, contributing to the 'X' shaped destruction pattern on the grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16239776332d396b902352ee025093cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0abd9d06cc1108aa2d33d0668e3a2f58</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X-1,Y+1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">56.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(x-1,y+1) is a direct propagation direction of Dragon's Breath flame, forming one arm of the 'X' pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame extends in the (x-1,y+1) direction diagonally across the grid, destroying monsters along that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates along the (x-1,y+1) direction from its center, destroying monsters in that diagonal line as part of its 'X' shape."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates flame along the (x-1,y+1) diagonal direction, destroying all monsters on that line from the firing point."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates flame along the diagonal direction (x-1,y+1) from the target, destroying all monsters along that line."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x-1,y+1) is a directional extension point of Dragon's Breath flame, contributing to the 'X' shaped destruction pattern on the grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d74783b73ceb32dae708b26591e446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16239776332d396b902352ee025093cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfc436139fa6006082f3b7f4127742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a7b2a080725c29db421d4e4ace60f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d5bda19778e26fdcdbd138b92cbbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0abd9d06cc1108aa2d33d0668e3a2f58</data>
