      <data key="d3">82.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O markers are placed within the 3x3 Grid cells to form rows, columns, or diagonals for winning conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"O symbols are placed within the 3x3 Grid to represent 炸鸡's moves and contribute to potential winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'O' symbols are placed within the 3x3 grid positions as part of 炸鸡's strategy to achieve three in a row."&lt;SEP&gt;"The symbol O is placed within the 3x3 grid to represent 炸鸡's moves, making the grid the spatial context for O placements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The O symbols are placed within the 3x3 Grid cells by炸鸡 as part of their strategy to achieve three in a row."&lt;SEP&gt;"The O symbols are placed within the 3x3 grid as part of炸鸡's strategy to achieve three in a row, column, or diagonal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The O marks are placed within the 3x3 Grid as part of 炸鸡's strategy to achieve three in a row."&lt;SEP&gt;"The O symbols are placed within the 3x3 grid as part of炸鸡's strategy to form a winning line."&lt;SEP&gt;"The O symbol is placed within cells of the 3x3 Grid to represent 炸鸡's moves, forming potential winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The symbol O is placed within cells of the 3x3 Grid by 炸鸡 during gameplay to claim positions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9094a057465f864e453c5144b5d5d992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705de323687561c70c4a2f8771b3b928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6530b007a9358e324c34f0aa9343b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864b5222b680eb70bf8268c99a7b1400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1b94b066ee2977324f512fa79346b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ce97d6733d48f34e9d3b2ae71fd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ee66e423ab2b4d0bfaddf5206078&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f9203ade2bda3f53be8c235e592782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5470d8b2aa46bdc4dcacc08c4ef251c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55c048498a23dc287d54f7c9494356f</data>
