    <edge source="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;" target="&quot;3X3 GRID&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 3x3 Grid is the physical and structural foundation of the tic-tac-toe game, defining the space where all moves and winning conditions occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the physical and structural foundation of the tic-tac-toe game, defining all possible move locations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the physical and structural foundation of the tic-tac-toe game, defining all possible move locations and winning conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tic-Tac-Toe Game is played entirely on the 3x3 Grid, which defines the spatial structure and constraints of all possible moves and winning conditions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d5470d8b2aa46bdc4dcacc08c4ef251c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1b94b066ee2977324f512fa79346b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ce97d6733d48f34e9d3b2ae71fd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864b5222b680eb70bf8268c99a7b1400</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
